<title>USA: PerfectData says Telmar bid is rejected.</title>
<headline>PerfectData says Telmar bid is rejected.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerfectData Corp on Tuesday said privately-held  Telmar Corp has rejected the $15.5 million acquisition offer made by PerfectData's 50-percent owned unit, Staruni Corp.</p>
<p>In a statement, PerfectData said it will continue to negotiate with Telmar while considering other options. It added that it is also looking at other possible acquisitions.</p>
<p>Staruni had offered $6.0 million in cash and $9.5 million in stock for Telmar, a resellor of telecommunications equipment based in Irvine, Calif.</p>
